        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>5.4.3　对照只替换这一个段落</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>对照段只写这四句</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 10 }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779', width: 1152 }}>两个标记之间的正文被原样替换为下面这四句，文件其他字节内容保持不变。</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 244, background: '#20344B', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 18, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
